Exposes `overridable-replacements.js` (the built-in `&` -> `and`, `♥` -> `love` and `🦄` -> `unicorn`
replacements) in `exports`, so that our `slugify` can pass them to the transliteration it runs
itself before calling the package with `transliterate: false`.

